# Hoenn & Seek (part 14): teams that replace Emerald's in src/data/trainers_hoenn.party.
# Read by tools/hoenn/gen_hoenn_ids.py. Lines before a block's first blank line replace
# those header keys; the rest replaces the Pokemon. Gym levels are placeholders:
# src/hoenn_scaling.c moves the strongest to the stamp curve and keeps the gaps.
# No Mega Stones anywhere (no Megas in Hoenn & Seek). Elite Four (Lv 76-81) and
# Wallace (Lv 80-84) have fixed levels.

